              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku haahingwireho ebiro, baagambira Sanibalati na Tobia na Geshemu Omuharabu n'abandi bazigu baitu, ku nyombekire orugo, kandi ku hatakiriho hasheenyukire, (n'obu ndaabe naabaire ntakataire nyigi mu marembo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanibalati na Geshemu, ku baakihuriire bantumaho nigabira bati: Ija tubugaabuganire omu kirorero kimwe omu ruhita rwa Ono. Kwonka bakaba nibenda kuunyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naanye nikwo kubatumaho entumwa, nkabagira nti: Ndi aha murimo muhango; tindikubaasa kushuuma okwo. Mbwenu omurimo gwemerere ngu nyizire okwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantumaho batyo kana, naanye nimbagarukamu ntyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Sanibalati yaagaruka yantumaho omuheereza we omurundi gwa kataano omu muringo ogwo, aine ebaruha eshashaanire omu ngaro ze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 23:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Egyo baruha ekaba ehandiikirwemu ebigambo ebirikugira biti: Nikigambwa omu mahanga, kandi na Geshemu naakigamba, ngu iwe n'Abayudaaya nimwenda kugoma; ngu nikyo murikwobekyera orugo; kandi ngu, nooyenda kuba omugabe waabo, nk'oku kirikugambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ngu, otaireho na baanabi b'okubuzya ebyawe omuri Yerusaalemu, ngu, Omuri Yuda harimu omugabe. Mbenu oije tuhanuure, ahabw'okuba ebyo bigambo tibiribura kugambirwa mugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naanye naamutumaho, nimmugira nti: Ebyo ebi waagamba tibikabahoga; kureka niiwe waabyegunzira omu mutima gwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona bakaba nibagira batyo, ngu batutiinise, nibateekateeka ngu emikono yaitu neija kutentebuka, omurimo nigureka kukorwa. Kwonak ai Ruhanga, gumya emikono yangye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
