        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.36.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 36:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima naaza owa Shemaaya mwene Delaaya, mwijukuru wa Mehetabeeli, owaabaire akomirwe; yangira ati: Ija tubugaabuganire omu nju ya Ruhanga omuri hekalu, tukingye enyigi zaayo; ahabw'okuba nibaija kukwita, eego, nibaija kukwita nyekiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamugarukamu nti: Omushaija nkaanye nimbaasa kuhunga? ni mushaija ki nkaanye orikubaasa kuhungira omuri hekalu, ngu akire? Tindikuzamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.13.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 13:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naayetegyereize, naamanya ku atatumirwe Ruhanga, kureka ku yandaguraho atyo, ahabw'okuguriirirwa Tobia na Sanibalati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki baamuguriririire, bakenda ngu antiinise, haza naanye nkore ntyo, nshiishe, ekiraarugyemu bangambeho kubi, banshekyerere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 13:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ai Ruhanga wangye, ijuka Tobia na Sanibalati, n'ebyo byona ebi barikukora, oijukye na nabikazi Noadia, na baanabi abandi boona, ababaire nibenda kuntiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rutyo orugo rwahwa aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bitaano ky'okwezi Eluli omu biro makumi ataano na bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.126.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 126:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.127.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "127:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abazigu baitu boona ku baakihuriire, n'amahanga goona agatwehinguririize gaakireeba, baatiina, baahwera kimwe eishaija, ahabw'okuba bakareeba ngu ogwo murimo gukozirwe ahabw'okuhwerwa Ruhanga waitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu biro ebyo abakungu b'Abayudaaya bakatwekyera Tobia ebaruha nyingi, n'eza Tobia zaabahikaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'eokuba baingi omuri Yuda bakaragaana nawe endagaano ahabw'okuba mukwe wa Shekania mwene Aara, kandi n'omutabani Yehohanani akaba ashweire muhara wa Meshulaamu mwene Berekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baagambira omu maisho gangye ebirungi ebi akora, baagaruka baamugambira n'ebigambo byangye. Atyo Tobia yaaguma nantwekyera ebaruha z'okuntiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
